                                "sense_id": "cac5bb2c-34c6-30ee-a3c2-17a2213c9716",
                                "text": "but I remember this, moms would lick her finger tips / to wipe the cold out my eye before school with her spit"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "308b844c-bb29-4549-9718-0f9a1436bf66",
                                "sense_id": "cac5bb2c-34c6-30ee-a3c2-17a2213c9716",
                                "text": "My moms, Noojie, had told me that the two little stumps on the sides of my hands came from being born with six fingers, and that's why I was always stealing something."
                            }
                        ]
